    "Model-safe ingress order now matches gateway: state/alias, new-message DLP and supervision, then whole-prompt secret scan.",
    "Tool-call arguments are scanned and inspected before Pi receives the tool_call; conditional embeddings and Guardian checks are represented, with embedding vectors distinct from Blackwall similarity scoring.",
