    "Guardian violation audit is split: guardian.reviewed precedes termination, and session.terminated follows it.",
    "Runtime policy publication is initiated by the approval/admin lane; active policies are shown as local configuration.",
    "The tool-output /v1/content/inspect exchange remains a collapsed internal subflow; its endpoint and allow/redact/block result are accurate, and component descriptions explain output inspection."
